</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      1. Support for comments: Ability to carry over IDL comments as annotations into the generated WSDLs. <br/>
<br/>
2. Support to specify IDL exclusion lists: Currently if an IDL includes another IDL, the generated WSDL/schema contains types associated with the base WSDL and the included WSDL in a single file. With the support for exclusion lists a user can decide not to generate/process included WSDLs. Such a support would help users better maintain/format generated WSDLs. <br/>

  </td>
