We currently have a copy of the jsr181 jar in our repository that we use for building.    We should consider replacing that with a &quot;clean room&quot; version.     Contributing such a version to geronimo-specs and using that would be a good thing.<br/>
<br/>
Currently, the old xfire codebase at codehaus has an implementation.   It would need to be verified for compatibility with sun&#39;s version (the Harmony team has a jar compare thing we could look at using) and then contributed to geronimo-specs.
  </td>
