                <tr id="issuerow12349336" rel="12349336" data-issuekey="CXF-35" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-35" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-35">CXF-35</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Support multiple services/bindings on the same endpoint
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            maomaode
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Dan Diephouse
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Dan Diephouse
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 06/Sep/06 20:15 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 02/May/13 02:28 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 23/Apr/07 03:53 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-33                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Use case 1: SOAP 1.1 and SOAP 1.2 on the same endpoint<br/>
<br/>
In this case we a soap 1.1 and soap 1.2 binding in our wsdl on the same endpoint address. This results in two bindingInfos and two endpointInfo in our service model. We need to be able to select the correct one based on whether soap 1.2 or 1.1 is used.<br/>
<br/>
Use case 2: Multiple services on the same endpoint, with a routing interceptor/handler<br/>
<br/>
I can write a wsdl with ports that use the same endpoint address, but have different port types. We need a mechanism for selecting the appropriate one or allow the user to write a mechanism to select the appropriate one.
  </td>
