                <tr id="issuerow12349380" rel="12349380" data-issuekey="CXF-42" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-42" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-42">CXF-42</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
            <span class="parentIssue">CXF-14</span>
                REST server side support: using JAX-WS provider
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Sub-task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jervis Liu
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jervis Liu
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Sep/06 08:27 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/Oct/06 08:20 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/Oct/06 08:20 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0-M1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-M1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When JAX-WS provider is used on server side to receive REST request, user&#39;s logic in provider implementation needs to access URL info in order to resolve operation name.  One way to to do this is putting URL into MessageContext. See[1] for an example. <br/>
<br/>
As the first step, we can add this feature to XML binding, i.e., make XML binding more restful. Later on we can create a REST binding.<br/>
<br/>
[1]. http://weblogs.java.net/blog/kohlert/archive/2006/01/publishing_a_re.html
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
