                                            <td class="description">      Celtix 1.0 has Geronimo integration working with Geronimo 1.0 release. After Celtix 1.0 release, IONA did some further integration work and made integration to work with Geronimo 1.1.1 release, and the patch was submitted to Genronimo community with JIRA GERONIMO-2030. Since CeltiXfire design has changed from Celtix 1.0 release, we need to port existing Celtix/Geronimo integration to new CeltiXfire architecture. The old design note for Celtix/Geronimo integration is at https://wiki.objectweb.org/celtix/Wiki.jsp?page=GeronimoDevPlan
