</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We need to support code first development of web services.<br/>
<br/>
More specifically:<br/>
1. Enhance ReflectionServiceFactory to build up a basic service model from from the service class and using the ServiceConfiguration<br/>
2. Enhance JaxWsServiceConfiguration to provide JAX-WS specific values<br/>
3. Ensure that Wrapping works without @Request/ResponseWrapper<br/>
4. Enhance the service factories to be able to create a simple binding for the service <br/>
5. Create an EndpointInfo in the JAX-WS EndpointInfo when we need to publish the service
  </td>
