                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I just used Benchmark wsdl [Benchmark] to generate JAXWS implementation<br/>
by wsdl2java and found out this is mix style (not only wrapped but also<br/>
bare) implementation.<br/>
Current CXF doesn&#39;t support the wrapped and bare message at the same time.<br/>
I just want to ask do we have any plan to support it, maybe this<br/>
milestone or next will support it.<br/>
<br/>
[Benchmark]http://svn.apache.org/viewcvs.cgi/webservices/axis2/trunk/java/modules/integration/test/samples/wsdl/bench/Benchmark.wsdl
