                <tr id="issuerow12353955" rel="12353955" data-issuekey="CXF-177" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-177" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-177">CXF-177</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Late test for null object reference - check intent
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            tli
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Michael Bricout
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Michael Bricout
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/Oct/06 15:04 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Aug/07 18:00 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 06/Nov/06 07:44 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0-M1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-M1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I stumbled accross this while browsing through the code. It may be of no consequence, however it might be worth double checking the intent:<br/>
<br/>
In org.apache.cxf.ws.addressing.ContextUtils.isOutbound(Message message): we call message.getExchange(), then only after that we check for a null message.<br/>
<br/>
    public static boolean isOutbound(Message message) {<br/>
        Exchange exchange = message.getExchange();<br/>
        return message != null<br/>
               &amp;&amp; exchange != null<br/>
               &amp;&amp; message == exchange.getOutMessage();<br/>
    }<br/>

  </td>
