                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hiya,<br/>
I started looking at the CXFServlet tonight, but I&#39;m a little confused. It seems that doPost/doGet are associated with one specific Endpoint (it is a field in the class). This would mean that you could only have one endpoint per servlet, which seems odd. Can someone shed some light? Are there any tests for this? I started one using HTTP Unit, but am still trying to figure out what is going on.<br/>
<br/>
- Dan<br/>

