</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If a RuntimeException is thrown in the implementor it gets changed to XMLFault with cause as  NoSuchMethodException type due to a bug in XMLFaultOutInterceptor. Also this XMLFault then further gets wrapped into Fault ...XMLFault. This needs to be fixed.<br/>
The behaviour should be a XMLFault with the original exception.
