</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      For application messages, the value of the action attribute is always null - the fallback solution to use the name of the Method object stored in the OperationInfo properties is broken since this property is no longer set.<br/>
See also CXF-210 which should obsolete the use of SoapOperationInfo in org.apache.cxf.ws.addresing.ContextUtils.getAction(Message message).
  </td>
