                <tr id="issuerow12357454" rel="12357454" data-issuekey="CXF-280" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-280" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-280">CXF-280</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Endpoint Specific Behaviour of RetransmissionQueue
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Andrea Smyth
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andrea Smyth
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andrea Smyth
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/Dec/06 14:11 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Aug/07 18:03 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 15/Mar/07 12:26 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Instead of managing separate retransmission queues oer endpoint, have the retransmission control the resends on a per endpoint basis, i.e. using the acknowlegement interval in the endpoint;&#39;s RMssertion. The acknowledgement intervals are potentially operation specific (although we may not support this initially).
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
