</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-1352                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We should look at supporting SOAP with attachments correctly in the runtime. I think the deserialization probably works correctly, but the AttachmentSerializer I wrote probably needs improvements. Specifically:<br/>
1. we should need to be able to write non application/xop+xml content types <br/>
2. We need to support writing 8bit Content-Transfer-Encodings (I think...)<br/>
3. We need to support Base64 encoding (and decoding?) of the attachments. 
  </td>
