                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I think commons http client is a must in terms of HTTP support as it supports a lot of different authentication modes that I don&#39;t know that we currently support. It shouldn&#39;t be that hard to integrate either. XFire users tend to depend pretty heavily on it. The XFire code can be found here:<br/>
