                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      we do not set the wsdl url for the ServiceFactoryBean in<br/>
CXFServlet . ServiceFactoryBean still get the wsdl location from the<br/>
annotaion by invoking JaxWsConfiguration .  When we deployed the war to<br/>
another machine ,  the service will fail to start  because  it can not find<br/>
the wsdl .<br/>

  </td>
