</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
This story is to add support for using Apache Qpid as a transport for CXF. Apache Qpid provides a JMS interface as well as a Native interface. This story is to use the existing JMS transport in CXF, and make it work for Qpid along-with the necessary tests and demos for the same.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
