                <tr id="issuerow12359255" rel="12359255" data-issuekey="CXF-323" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-323" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-323">CXF-323</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Improper synchronization of getDefaultBus(), setDefaultBus()
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jarek Gawor
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jarek Gawor
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Dec/06 04:27 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Aug/07 02:05 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 31/Jan/07 19:57 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      getDefaultBus() method in org.apache.cxf.bus.spring.SpringBusFactory and org.apache.cxf.bus.cxf.CXFBusFactory is improperly synchronized. The method is instance-level synchronized while it initializes and accesses a class-level variable. Two different instances of BusFactory each calling getDefaultBus() at the same time could return two different Bus instances...<br/>
<br/>
This method should either be changed to &#39;public static synchronized Bus getDefaultBus()&#39; or modified as for an example:<br/>
<br/>
public Bus getDefaultBus() {<br/>
  return initDefaultBus();<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
private static synchronized Bus initDefaultBus() {<br/>
  if (null == defaultBus) {<br/>
         defaultBus = new CXFBusImpl();<br/>
  }<br/>
  return defaultBus;<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
Also, the setDefaultBus() method in both classes needs to be properly synchronized. <br/>

  </td>
