    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-341" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-341">CXF-341</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Display user supplied wsdl in HTTP transports
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Dan Diephouse
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Dan Diephouse
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 29/Dec/06 18:57 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 18/Aug/08 18:26 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 16/Jun/08 17:40 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0-M1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">2</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently the HTTP transports are always generating a WSDL instead of using the user supplied one. <br/>
<br/>
Before changing this we should discuss a wsdl management mechanism. Such a mechanism would ideally include:<br/>
1. A mechanism to display different wsdls for one service<br/>
2. The ability to generate or have a user supplied WSDL<br/>
3. Support for wsdl 1.1 or wsdl2<br/>

  </td>
