                <tr id="issuerow12359639" rel="12359639" data-issuekey="CXF-342" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-342" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-342">CXF-342</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Servlet transport should be independent of the JAX-WS frontend
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Eoghan Glynn
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Eoghan Glynn
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 02/Jan/07 14:33 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Aug/07 18:04 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 12/Mar/07 07:08 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The servlet transport is implemented as part of the JAX-WS frontend, but the only real dependency on JAX-WS is the hardcoding of the instantiation of org.apache.cxf.jaxws.EndpointImpl and the Endpoint.publish() call. <br/>
<br/>
This should be done via reflection instead, with  the class to instantiate and the publish method configured in the cxf-servlet.xml.<br/>
<br/>
That way the servlet transport could be used with any front-end (as opposed to be being limited to JAX-WS) and the code could be moved out of the rt-frontend-jaxws module and into the rt-transpots-http module.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310060"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310220">            <span title="18/Jan/07 16:58"><time class="livestamp allow-future" datetime="2007-01-18T16:58:31+0000">18/Jan/07 4:58 PM</time></span>
    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312322"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312520"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312323"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312521">    10 years, 28 weeks, 4 days ago

                        </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312320"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310420">      111202
  </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312321"></td>
