                <tr id="issuerow12359781" rel="12359781" data-issuekey="CXF-352" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-352" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-352">CXF-352</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Update WS-A MessageID and WS-RM  Acknowledgement headers in resent messages
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Dennis Sosnoski
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andrea Smyth
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andrea Smyth
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/Jan/07 11:41 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Mar/14 00:55 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 22/Mar/14 00:55 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">2</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently a message is resent as is. This implies use of the originally assigned messageID, and works because we are by default tolerant against duplicate messageIDs .  To be strictly compliant, the resent  message should be given a new ID. Once we are updating the headers, we may also either remove any pre-existing SequenceAcknowledgement header (it  may be out-of-date, but that does not cause any harm) or, for  efficiency, replace it with an up-to-date SequenceAcknowledgement.<br/>
Requires re-running the message through a selective chain of  interceptors or else a manual approach to updating the headers in question. and subsequently re-marshalling the messge.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
