                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Add in the ability to recieve notification of when an endpoints server starts and stops, and get info on that server instance.<br/>
 <br/>
Propose adding in a ServerLifeCycleManager and ServerLifeCycleListener to the api&#39;s.<br/>
 <br/>
Something along the lines of :<br/>
 <br/>
org.apache.cxf.endpoint.ServerLifeCycleManager { <br/>
        startServer(org.apache.cxf.endpoint.Server server)<br/>
        stopServer(org.apache.cxf.endpoint.Server  server)<br/>
        registerListener(ServerLifeCycleListener listener)<br/>
        unRegisterListener(ServerLifeCycleListener listener)<br/>
    }<br/>
 <br/>
  org.apache.cxf.endpoint.ServerLifeCycleListener {<br/>
        startServer(org.apache.cxf.endpoint.Server server)<br/>
        stopServer(org.apache.cxf.endpoint.Server server) <br/>
  }<br/>
 <br/>
where the ServerImpl would be modified to access the ServerLifeCycleManager.<br/>

  </td>
