                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF currently uses ActiveMQ 4.1 [1]. ActiveMQ 4.1 introduces a new main jar name:<br/>
<br/>
ActiveMQ 4.0.X jar name: incubator-activemq-${activemq.version}.jar<br/>
ActiveMQ 4.1 jar name: apache-activemq-${activemq.version}.jar <br/>
<br/>
So, the jms_pubsub and jms_queue samples should be updated to use this new jar name. <br/>
<br/>
[1] Relevant snippet from https://svn.apache.org/repos/asf/incubator/cxf/trunk/pom.xml<br/>
&lt;activemq.version&gt;4.1.0-incubator&lt;/activemq.version&gt;
  </td>
