                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-400                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When a Conduit detects a non-transient connection-establishment failure, it sould refresh the EPR via the EndpointResolverRegistry bus extension before attempting a transparent rebind.<br/>
<br/>
The number of rebind attempts and the intra-rebind delay should be configurable at the Bus level, as opposed to per-transport. Thus this logic should be factored out into a component sharable across transports (e.g. in the AbstractConduit).
  </td>
