                <tr id="issuerow12362032" rel="12362032" data-issuekey="CXF-407" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-407" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-407">CXF-407</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Create a JAXB client without wsdl-to-java step
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Dan Diephouse
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Paul R. Brown
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Paul R. Brown
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Feb/07 19:55 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 08/Feb/07 17:10 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 08/Feb/07 17:10 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core,                     JAXB Databinding,                     Service Model            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The goal is to allow someone to create a client without ever running wsdl2java.  The attached patch augments some of the core CXF classes in trivial ways and provides a factory class that creates client instances from a WSDL URL.  The context classloader is augmented to include the JAXB-generated classes for the client, so request/response objects need to be created/accessed with reflection (or using a dynamic language like Groovy or JRuby or...).<br/>
<br/>
Hope that this is useful.
  </td>
