                <tr id="issuerow12362218" rel="12362218" data-issuekey="CXF-413" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-413" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-413">CXF-413</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Tools2 needs fixing to support soap headers in rpc/literal case
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            maomaode
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Feb/07 17:04 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Aug/07 02:05 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 19/Mar/07 11:49 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0-M1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
The tools were updated to generate proper code for soap headers in the rpc/literal case while testing CXF-261.   The tools2 modules should be updated as well.   The problem was that the tools were only looking at the operation to determine if a part is &quot;document&quot; or &quot;rpc&quot; style.   However, soap headers are ALWAYS document style.   Thus, the @WebParam annotation did not have the correct namespace and name attributes.<br/>
<br/>
The soapheader_rpc.wsdl added to testutils shows this and a unit test was added to testutils to make sure the generated code for that wsdl is correct.   It passes with tools1.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
