                <tr id="issuerow12364098" rel="12364098" data-issuekey="CXF-446" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-446" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-446">CXF-446</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Allow JAX-WS implementation bean not to implement the service endpoint interface
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jarek Gawor
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jarek Gawor
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Mar/07 05:45 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Aug/07 18:04 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/Mar/07 08:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      JAX-WS services (as per spec) are not required to implement the service endpoint interface. Right now, if the service does not implement the SEI, a &quot;object is not an instance of&quot; error is returned on an invocation. The attached patch enables the services not to implement the SEI and contains test for such cases.<br/>
<br/>
This patch also contains updated test cases for CXF-444.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
