                                            <td class="description">      /testutils/src/main/resources/wsdl/jms_test.wsdl issues:<br/>
<br/>
* R2716/R2726 WSI-BasicProfile ver. 1.0, namespace attribute not allowed in doc/lit or rpc/lit for soapbind:fault: &quot;BadRecordLitFault&quot;<br/>
* R2716/R2726 WSI-BasicProfile ver. 1.0, namespace attribute not allowed in doc/lit or rpc/lit for soapbind:fault: &quot;NoSuchCodeLitFault&quot;<br/>
* in message &quot;NoSuchCodeLitFault&quot;, part &quot;NoSuchCodeLit&quot; must specify a &quot;element&quot; attribute<br/>
* BadRecord not used in the wsdl, which i think should be chaged to BadRecordLit and the part BadRecordLitFault should ref this element.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Tools should also throws exceptions/warnings for those errors.<br/>

