                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m getting the following exception:<br/>
<br/>
java.lang.IllegalStateException: All endpoints must share the same portType<br/>
        at org.apache.cxf.wsdl11.WSDLServiceBuilder.buildService(WSDLServiceBuilder.java:174)<br/>
        at org.apache.cxf.wsdl11.WSDLServiceBuilder.buildService(WSDLServiceBuilder.java:144)<br/>
        at org.apache.cxf.wsdl11.WSDLServiceFactory.create(WSDLServiceFactory.java:91)<br/>
