                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The wsdllocation annotation can be present in the implementor class but absent in the endpointInterface. In JaxWsImplementorInfo when getWsdlLocation() method is invoked, it checks if seiAnnotation is present. Since it is present it just returns seiAnnotation.wsdlLocation(), which will be empty string.<br/>
Ideally it should check if it is non-empty else read the attribute from the implementor class.<br/>

