  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      WS-RM sample fails with following error:<br/>
 [java] WS-RM retransmission of message 4.<br/>
     [java] WS-RM retransmission of message 4.<br/>
     [java] Mar 16, 2007 2:59:04 PM org.apache.cxf.ws.rm.soap.RetransmissionQueueImpl$1 resend<br/>
     [java] WARNING: WS-RM retransmission failed.<br/>
