                <tr id="issuerow12365498" rel="12365498" data-issuekey="CXF-480" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-480" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-480">CXF-480</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Interceptor lists should use thread-safe list impls
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Fred Dushin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Fred Dushin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Mar/07 19:22 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Apr/07 04:17 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 23/Apr/07 04:17 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0-M1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The InterceptorProvider interface is essentially implemented by 2 classes in CXF: AbstractAttributedInterceptorProvider and AbstractBasicIntercetptorProvider.  The interceptor lists stored in these base types are implemented as ArrayLists.  However, ArrayLists are not thread-safe, so traversal of said interceptor lists is sensitive to underlying modifications by other interceptors or threads.  These maps should be implemented by the java.util.concurrent.CopyOnWriteArrayList type.<br/>
<br/>
Tested patch to follow.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
