                                            <td class="description">      I have a code snippet like below:<br/>
<br/>
        Object implementor = new GreeterImplMixedStyle();<br/>
        String address = &quot;http://localhost:9027/SoapContext/SoapPort&quot;;<br/>
        Endpoint.publish(address, implementor);<br/>
        <br/>
        Object implementor1 = new GreeterImplMixedStyle();<br/>
        String address1 = &quot;http://localhost:9027/SoapContext1/SoapPort&quot;;<br/>
        Endpoint.publish(address1, implementor1);<br/>
<br/>
However this does not work as I got an &quot;Address already in use: bind&quot; exception. 
