    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-523" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-523">CXF-523</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ConcurrentModificationException thrown by createJAXBContext() when run java2wsdl
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            maomaode
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            William Tam
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            William Tam
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 12/Apr/07 20:57 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Aug/07 18:06 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/Apr/07 06:22 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      untar the attached tarball to C:\dbtest and run the following command:<br/>
<br/>
java2wsdl -cp C:\dbtest  com.iona.dbtest.Database<br/>
<br/>
and the follow stacktrace is observed<br/>
<br/>
java.util.ConcurrentModificationException<br/>
        at java.util.HashMap$HashIterator.nextEntry(HashMap.java:841)<br/>
        at java.util.HashMap$KeyIterator.next(HashMap.java:877)<br/>
        at org.apache.cxf.jaxb.JAXBDataBinding.createJAXBContext(JAXBDataBinding.java:338)<br/>
        at org.apache.cxf.jaxb.JAXBDataBinding.initialize(JAXBDataBinding.java:246)<br/>
        at org.apache.cxf.service.factory.ReflectionServiceFactoryBean.buildServiceFromClassReflectionServiceFactoryBean.java:211)<br/>
        at org.apache.cxf.service.factory.ReflectionServiceFactoryBean.initializeServiceModel(ReflectionServiceFactoryBean.java:228)<br/>
        at org.apache.cxf.service.factory.ReflectionServiceFactoryBean.create(ReflectionServiceFactoryBean.java:128)<br/>
        at org.apache.cxf.frontend.AbstractEndpointFactory.createEndpoint(AbstractEndpointFactory.java:73)<br/>
        at org.apache.cxf.tools.java2wsdl.processor.internal.ServiceBuilder.build(ServiceBuilder.java:39)<br/>
