                <tr id="issuerow12367287" rel="12367287" data-issuekey="CXF-535" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-535" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-535">CXF-535</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Service Listing at root of CXF servlet contains usless &#39;/&#39; in the return urls
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 16/Apr/07 14:45 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Aug/07 02:05 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Apr/07 01:32 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0-RC            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-898                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If I go to the root mapping of my CXF servlet (in my case,<br/>
http://localhost:8080/myapp/services/), it lists my deployed services.<br/>
<br/>
The links however, are broken.  Instead of:<br/>
http://localhost:8080/myapp/services/MyService?wsdl<br/>
it is:<br/>
http://localhost:8080/myapp/services//MyService?wsdl<br/>
<br/>
My web.xml file contains:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;servlet&gt;<br/>
  &lt;servlet-name&gt;CXFServlet&lt;/servlet-name&gt;<br/>
  &lt;servlet-class&gt;<br/>
    org.apache.cxf.transport.servlet.CXFServlet<br/>
  &lt;/servlet-class&gt;<br/>
  &lt;load-on-startup&gt;1&lt;/load-on-startup&gt;<br/>
&lt;/servlet&gt;<br/>
&lt;servlet-mapping&gt;<br/>
  &lt;servlet-name&gt;CXFServlet&lt;/servlet-name&gt;<br/>
  &lt;url-pattern&gt;/services/*&lt;/url-pattern&gt;<br/>
&lt;/servlet-mapping&gt;<br/>
<br/>
And my spring-config file contains:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;import resource=&quot;classpath:META-INF/cxf/cxf.xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;import resource=&quot;classpath:META-INF/cxf/cxf-extension-soap.xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;import resource=&quot;classpath:META-INF/cxf/cxf-servlet.xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
&lt;jaxws:endpoint<br/>
    id=&quot;myWebServiceEndpoint&quot;<br/>
    implementor=&quot;myWebService&quot;<br/>
    address=&quot;/services/MyService&quot;<br/>
    wsdlLocation=&quot;myservice.wsdl&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;jaxws:inInterceptors&gt;<br/>
    &lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.interceptor.LoggingInInterceptor&quot; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/jaxws:inInterceptors&gt;<br/>
  &lt;jaxws:outInterceptors&gt;<br/>
    &lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.interceptor.LoggingOutInterceptor&quot; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/jaxws:outInterceptors&gt;<br/>
&lt;/jaxws:endpoint&gt;<br/>

  </td>
