                                            <td class="description">      &lt;element name=&quot;sayHi&quot;&gt;<br/>
                &lt;xs:complexType&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;xs:sequence&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;xs:element name=&quot;port&quot; minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; maxOccurs=&quot;unbounded&quot;&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;xs:complexType&gt;<br/>
                                &lt;xs:sequence&gt;<br/>
                                    &lt;xs:any namespace=&quot;##other&quot; processContents=&quot;lax&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; maxOccurs=&quot;unbounded&quot;--&gt;<br/>
                                    &lt;/xs:any&gt;<br/>
                                    &lt;!--element name=&quot;requestType&quot; type=&quot;string&quot;/--&gt;<br/>
                                &lt;/xs:sequence&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;/xs:complexType&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;/xs:element&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;/xs:sequence&gt;<br/>
<br/>
                &lt;/xs:complexType&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/element&gt;<br/>
this element include xs:any, which is a kind of wildcard, according to jaxws-specs, shouldn&#39;t generate code using wrapper style
