                                            <td class="description">      javatowsdl fails when Wrapper bean class does not contain namespace, for example following code works, <br/>
<br/>
@XmlAccessorType(XmlAccessType.FIELD)<br/>
@XmlType(name = &quot;&quot;, propOrder = {&quot;responseType&quot; }, namespace = &quot;http://cxf.com/&quot;)<br/>
@XmlRootElement(name = &quot;getPrice&quot;, namespace = &quot;http://cxf.com/&quot;)<br/>
public class GetPrice {<br/>
..............    <br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
But if we remove namespace = &quot;http://cxf.com/&quot; attribute, test failes. <br/>
<br/>
How to reproduce: go to JaxwsServiceBuilderTest.testDocLitWrappedWithWrapperClass() test, modify the trunk\tools\javato\src\test\java\org\apache\cxf\tools\fortest\withannotation\doc\jaxws\GetPrice.java, remove namespace as described above.
