                <tr id="issuerow12367960" rel="12367960" data-issuekey="CXF-596" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-596" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-596">CXF-596</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ContentID generated incorrectly for MTOM attachments
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Chris Moesel
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Chris Moesel
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 24/Apr/07 17:05 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Aug/07 18:10 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 23/May/07 03:50 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0-RC            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The generated ContentID for MTOM binary attachments is generated incorrectly.  It appears that the entire CID is URL-encoded, causing the @ to be changed to %40.  This in turn causes interoperability problems with Axis2.<br/>
<br/>
Although I am not entirely familiar with the CID spec, the RFC appears to indicate that some level of URL-encoding should occur, but in all its examples, the @ is never URL-encoded:<br/>
http://www.apps.ietf.org/rfc/rfc2111.html
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
