</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      one problem I encounter is server side throw exception as<br/>
org.xml.sax.SAXParseException: sch-props-correct.2: A schema cannot contain two global components with the same name; this schema contains two occurrences of &#39;http://www.iona.com/com.iona.test.TestInterface/xsd,getMessage&#39;.<br/>
<br/>
when build service from class.<br/>
<br/>
I print out the schema in ReflectionServiceFactoryBean<br/>
it&#39;s <br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;utf-8&quot;?&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:schema xmlns=&quot;http://www.iona.com/com.iona.test.TestInterface/xsd&quot; xmlns:xs=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema&quot; attributeFormDefault=&quot;unqualified&quot; elementFormDefault=&quot;unqualified&quot; targetNamespace=&quot;http://www.iona.com/com.iona.test.TestInterface/xsd&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xs:element name=&quot;charEl_return&quot;&gt;<br/>
                &lt;xs:complexType&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;xs:sequence&gt;<br/>
                                &lt;xs:element name=&quot;varChar&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
                                &lt;xs:element name=&quot;varInt&quot; type=&quot;xs:int&quot;/&gt;<br/>
                                &lt;xs:element name=&quot;varString&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;/xs:sequence&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/xs:complexType&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/xs:element&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xs:element name=&quot;charEl_x&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xs:element name=&quot;charEl_y&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xs:element name=&quot;charEl_z&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xs:element name=&quot;getMessage&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xs:element name=&quot;getMessageResponse&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xs:element name=&quot;setMessage&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xs:element name=&quot;setMessageResponse&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xs:element name=&quot;getMessage&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xs:element name=&quot;getMessageResponse&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xs:element name=&quot;charEl_x&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xs:element name=&quot;setMessage&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xs:element name=&quot;setMessageResponse&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xs:schema&gt;<br/>
<br/>
we can see that in this schema several duplicated element. I believe the error is caused by when we generated schema element from method parameter, we didn&#39;t check if the same parameter type alreay added.<br/>

  </td>
