</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
            <span class="parentIssue">CXF-46</span>
                Handler&#39;s close method is not called when runtime exception is thrown from handleFault
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Sub-task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
