                <tr id="issuerow12368292" rel="12368292" data-issuekey="CXF-614" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-614" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-614">CXF-614</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Runtime builds an extra  element for String[]  in schema when execute buildServiceFromClass()
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Jim Ma
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jim Ma
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jim Ma
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Apr/07 03:43 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Aug/07 18:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 16/May/07 07:56 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Runtime generate the following schema in wsdl :<br/>
<br/>
&lt;xs:complexType name=&quot;operation0ResponseType&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:sequence&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:element minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; name=&quot;birth&quot; type=&quot;xs:dateTime&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:element minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; name=&quot;death&quot; type=&quot;xs:dateTime&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:element minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; name=&quot;name&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:element minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; name=&quot;owner&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:element minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; name=&quot;sex&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:element minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; name=&quot;species&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xs:sequence&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xs:complexType&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:complexType final=&quot;#all&quot; name=&quot;operation0ResponseTypeArray&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:sequence&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:element maxOccurs=&quot;unbounded&quot; minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; name=&quot;item&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;tns:operation0ResponseType&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xs:sequence&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xs:complexType&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:element name=&quot;operation0&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:complexType&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:sequence/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xs:complexType&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xs:element&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:element name=&quot;operation0Response&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:complexType&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:sequence&gt;<br/>
&lt;xs:element name=&quot;return&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;tns:operation0ResponseTypeArray&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xs:sequence&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xs:complexType&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Type &quot;operation0ResponseTypeArray&quot; should be removed .<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
