</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Running the hello_world sample I got these soap message for the greetMeOneWayResponse operation, <br/>
<br/>
Client<br/>
<br/>
POST /GreeterContext/GreeterPort HTTP/1.1<br/>
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=UTF-8<br/>
SOAPAction: &quot;&quot;<br/>
Cache-Control: no-cache<br/>
Pragma: no-cache<br/>
User-Agent: Java/1.5.0_11<br/>
Host: localhost:9090<br/>
Accept: text/html, image/gif, image/jpeg, *; q=.2, */*; q=.2<br/>
Connection: keep-alive<br/>
Transfer-Encoding: chunked<br/>
<br/>
111<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;&lt;soap:Body&gt;&lt;greetMeOneWay xmlns:ns2=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing/wsdl&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://cxf.iona.com/test/greeter/types&quot;&gt;&lt;requestType&gt;hello&lt;/requestType&gt;&lt;/greetMeOneWay&gt;&lt;/soap:Body&gt;&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
0<br/>
<br/>
Server<br/>
<br/>
HTTP/1.1 200 OK<br/>
Content-Type: text/xml<br/>
SOAPAction: &quot;&quot;<br/>
Transfer-Encoding: chunked<br/>
Server: Jetty(6.1.2rc0)<br/>
<br/>
AF<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;&lt;soap:Body&gt;&lt;greetMeOneWayResponse xmlns=&quot;http://cxf.iona.com/test/greeter&quot; /&gt;&lt;/soap:Body&gt;&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
There should not be any greetMeOneWayResponse. <br/>
<br/>
If I specified the wsdlLocation in the implementor class, the server will not return the greetMeOneWayResponse.
  </td>
