                <tr id="issuerow12368321" rel="12368321" data-issuekey="CXF-617" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-617" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-617">CXF-617</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Standalone Jetty Server Does Not Modify soap:address As Needed
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Chris Moesel
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Chris Moesel
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Apr/07 16:45 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Aug/07 02:03 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 18/May/07 08:49 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0-RC            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The standalone jetty server does not dynamically modify the soap:address in the wsdl.  This should occur similar to how it occurs in CXFServlet.<br/>
<br/>
Essentially, the host name and port should be extracted from the request for the wsdl and inserted as the host name and port in the soap:address of the returned wsdl.  This would allow standalone deployments to be portable across servers.
  </td>
