                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When ant client.get is run, you get the following:	<br/>
<br/>
Buildfile: build.xml<br/>
maybe.generate.code:<br/>
compile:<br/>
build:<br/>
client.get:<br/>
     [java] Invoking server through HTTP GET to invoke sayHi<br/>
