</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
            <span class="parentIssue">CXF-46</span>
                When handleMessage throws ProtocolException, the Message should be replaced with a fault Message
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Sub-task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Jervis Liu
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jervis Liu
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jervis Liu
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 03/May/07 03:46 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Aug/07 18:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 04/May/07 16:19 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      JAX-WS 9.3.2.1:<br/>
    Throw ProtocolException or a subclass This indicates that normal message processing should cease. <br/>
    Subsequent actions depend on whether the MEP in use requires a response to the message currently <br/>
    being processed or not:<br/>
    Response Normal message processing stops, fault message processing starts. The message direction <br/>
    is reversed, if the message is not already a fault message then it is replaced with a fault message, <br/>
    and the runtime invokes handleFault on the next handler or dispatches the message (see <br/>
    section 9.1.2.2) if there are no further handlers.<br/>
<br/>
See test case:HandlerChainInvokerTest.testHandleMessageThrowsProtocolExceptionWithResponseExpected()
  </td>
