                <tr id="issuerow12369101" rel="12369101" data-issuekey="CXF-644" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-644" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-644">CXF-644</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Allow determination of the Features applied to an endpoint
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Eoghan Glynn
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Eoghan Glynn
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Eoghan Glynn
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/May/07 11:29 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Aug/07 18:10 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/May/07 15:10 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Allow programmatic determination of the Features applied to an endpoint, for example from within ServerLifeCycleListener.startServer() .<br/>
<br/>
This particular feature wouldn&#39;t necessarily be involved in installing interceptors or whatever else a feature usually does in initialize(). Instead it would just be the *presence* of the  feature that causes the ServerLifeCycleListener to take a particular course of action.<br/>
<br/>
This could be acheived via a new setFeautures() method on org.apache.cxf.endpoint.EndpointImpl, which would be called by ServerFactoryBean.create() on the endpoint created via AbstractServiceFactoryBean.create()
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
