INFO: Create Schema jar:file:/C:/.m2/repository/org/apache/cxf/cxf-tools-common/2.0-incubator-RC-SNAPSHOT/cxf-tools-common-2.0-incubator-RC-SNAPSHOT.jar!/schemas/wsdl/jms.xsd which was loaded from jar<br/>
