                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      the code generated with cxf tool for the mtosi wsdl file ConfigurationService.wsdl is wrong. <br/>
The return type of the operation getTransmissionDescriptor should be void and we should have an additional argument <br/>
representing an out. <br/>
The part of the wsdl ,which is not correctly handled, is at the bottom of this page . <br/>
<br/>
    public v1.tmf854.GetTransmissionDescriptorResponseT getTransmissionDescriptor( <br/>
        @WebParam(targetNamespace = &quot;tmf854.v1&quot;, header = true, mode = Mode.INOUT, partName = &quot;mtosiHeader&quot;, name = &quot;header&quot;) <br/>
        javax.xml.ws.Holder&lt;v1.tmf854.HeaderT&gt; mtosiHeader, <br/>
        @WebParam(targetNamespace = &quot;tmf854.v1&quot;, partName = &quot;mtosiBody&quot;, name = &quot;getTransmissionDescriptor&quot;) <br/>
        v1.tmf854.GetTransmissionDescriptorT mtosiBody <br/>
    ) throws ProcessingFailureException; <br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
&lt;wsdl:message name=&quot;getTransmissionDescriptor&quot;&gt; <br/>
    &lt;wsdl:documentation&gt; <br/>
    The getTransmissionDescriptor request message. <br/>
    &lt;/wsdl:documentation&gt; <br/>
    &lt;wsdl:part name=&quot;mtosiHeader&quot; element=&quot;tmf854XSD:header&quot;/&gt; <br/>
    &lt;wsdl:part name=&quot;mtosiBody&quot; element=&quot;tmf854XSD:getTransmissionDescriptor&quot;/&gt; <br/>
  &lt;/wsdl:message&gt; <br/>
  &lt;wsdl:message name=&quot;getTransmissionDescriptorResponse&quot;&gt; <br/>
    &lt;wsdl:documentation&gt; <br/>
    The getTransmissionDescriptor response message. <br/>
    &lt;/wsdl:documentation&gt; <br/>
    &lt;wsdl:part name=&quot;mtosiHeader&quot; element=&quot;tmf854XSD:header&quot;/&gt; <br/>
    &lt;wsdl:part name=&quot;mtosiBody&quot; element=&quot;tmf854XSD:getTransmissionDescriptorResponse&quot;/&gt; <br/>
  &lt;/wsdl:message&gt; 
  </td>
