                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I suppose we can dump messages sending/receiving by CXF by enabling logging. Actually we do have a LoggingOutInterceptor/LoggingInInterceptor to serve this purpose, we can add them manually by code like ep.getServer().getEndpoint().getInInterceptors().add(new LoggingInInterceptor());. But I would like to see this done automatically when I enable CXF logging. 
