    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-676" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-676">CXF-676</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Fix public URIs for http://cxf.apache.org/configuration/security schema
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andrea Smyth
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andrea Smyth
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 23/May/07 13:39 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Aug/07 18:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 13/Jun/07 21:19 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Configuration            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The URI for this schema is currently made known to Spring&#39;s validating parse as:<br/>
http\://cxf.apache.org/../../../../../../common/schemas/src/main/resources/schemas/configuration/security.xsd<br/>
(see spring.schemas in rt-transports/http).<br/>
This actually works when used in a config file like the one below but is not a suitable URI for users:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;beans xmlns=&quot;http://www.springframework.org/schema/beans&quot;<br/>
       xmlns:beans=&quot;http://www.springframework.org/schema/beans&quot;<br/>
       xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;<br/>
       xmlns:h=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/transports/http/configuration&quot;<br/>
       xmlns:s=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/configuration/security&quot;<br/>
       xsi:schemaLocation=&quot;<br/>
http://cxf.apache.org/transports/http/configuration http://cxf.apache.org/schema/transports/http.xsd<br/>
http://cxf.apache.org/configuration/security http://cxf.apache.org/../../../../../../common/schemas/src/main/resources/schemas/configuration/security.xsd<br/>
http://www.springframework.org/schema/beans http://www.springframework.org/schema/beans/spring-beans.xsd&quot;&gt;<br/>
  <br/>
    &lt;h:destination id=&quot;{urn:test:ns}Foo.http-destination&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;h:server ContentEncoding=&quot;foobar&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/h:destination&gt;<br/>
    <br/>
    &lt;h:conduit id=&quot;{urn:test:ns}Foo.http-conduit&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;h:client ConnectionTimeout=&quot;97&quot;/&gt;<br/>
      &lt;h:sslClient&gt;<br/>
      &lt;!-- Spring&#39;s validating parser will complain about 97 not beeing an valid value for a boolean --&gt;<br/>
        &lt;s:SessionCaching&gt;97&lt;/s:SessionCaching&gt; <br/>
      &lt;/h:sslClient&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/h:conduit&gt;<br/>
&lt;/beans&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Also: register the schema where it is located, i.e. in spring.schemas file in cxf-common-schemas. instead of cxf-rt-transports-http.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
