                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Java 5
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Spring integration can fail when external Java archives are incorporated.  I&#39;m not sure this is relevant to this forum, as the problem was encountered using Celtix Enterprise 1.1 ... but here goes: to reproduce the symptom, start with the sample Spring-hosted service endpoint and add a &quot;lib&quot; subdirectory; dump in a wad of Java archives (JBoss Rules should do the trick); add a &lt;lib dir=&quot;lib&quot;/&gt; to the create.war task in build.xml; run the create.war task; run the copy.war task; start up the Spring container and watch the fireworks.
  </td>
