                <tr id="issuerow12370899" rel="12370899" data-issuekey="CXF-699" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-699" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-699">CXF-699</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Caching the wsdl that multi endpoints share to speed up the time of the service models building up from the wsdl
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Jun/07 09:19 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Feb/08 21:36 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/Feb/08 19:09 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In my WAR file I have Spring configuration file which defines collection (about 10) of endpoints (&lt;jaxws:endpoint&gt;).<br/>
In every endpoint there is wsdlLocation attribute which defines path to WSDL file.<br/>
Unfortunately it takes about 3 minutes to publish all my services.<br/>
I suppose that the same wsdl file (which is quite complex) is parsed as many times as number of endpoints.<br/>
<br/>
Is there any option to make this process faster, eg. if every time it is the same file? 
  </td>
