                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Changed the thirdparty.classpath property to be used  as a refid and not as location .<br/>
In this way we can setup more than one jar in the thirdparty.classpath <br/>
<br/>
So the thirdpath jar would be used in sample like this <br/>
<br/>
&lt;property environment=&quot;env&quot;/&gt;<br/>
     &lt;path id=&quot;sample.thirdpart.classpath&quot;&gt;<br/>
         &lt;pathelement location=&quot;thirdpart1.jar&quot;/&gt;<br/>
         &lt;pathelement location=&quot;thirdpart2.jar&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/path&gt;<br/>
    &lt;property name=&quot;thirdparty.classpath&quot; refid=&quot;sample.thirdpart.classpath&quot;/&gt;<br/>
   &lt;import file=&quot;../../common_build.xml&quot;/&gt; 
  </td>
