                                            <td class="description">      Enclosed patch standardizes the Ant build text for the samples (except the JMS ones, I did not get to cover those):<br/>
<br/>
1.)  Name of directory is generic in each file<br/>
2.)  Where applicable, now all READMEs state to run &quot;ant server&quot; and &quot;ant client&quot; in different command-line windows.<br/>
3.)  Now all READMEs states that the client and server tasks also run build (also removed &quot;build&quot; task from list)<br/>
<br/>
Also, a few build.xml&#39;s had the wrong project name.  I updated those.
  </td>
