                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If the Provider API is used in MESSAGE or PAYLOAD mode Then there are couple of redundant interceptors like WrapperClassInInterceptor, HolderInInterceptor present in the chain. Also the response chain would be having the symmetric out interceptors that are not required.<br/>
Along the lines of Dispatch Interceptor chain , these interceptors also are a candidate fro removal.
