                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF samples can use some improvement along with following ideas:<br/>
1. rename/reorganize samples to be align with documentation, and from use case perspective. Initial thinking of organizing/rename samples as following:<br/>
 - wsdlfirst<br/>
 - javafirst-annotations<br/>
 - javafirst-pojo<br/>
 - javafirst-spring-support<br/>
 - other samples related to jax-ws features<br/>
 - ws-*samples<br/>
 - jbi-integration samples<br/>
 - jca-integration samples<br/>
 - jms samples<br/>
 - secure-https sample<br/>
 - in-jvm transport sample<br/>
 - etc ...<br/>
<br/>
2. each sample shall have ant target for running sample in standalone or servlet mode, make things easier for users. for example:<br/>
 - ant server-stanalone (or something similar)<br/>
 - ant server-tomcat (or something similar)
  </td>
