                                            <td class="environment">      Windows, not that it matters.
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Neither the tarball nor the zip file for the 2.0 binary distro includes jsr181-api-1.0-MR1.jar. However, http://cwiki.apache.org/CXF20DOC/writing-a-service-with-spring.html <br/>
<br/>
calls for it. As I try to migrate some code from XFire, I find that my old imports of javax.jws.Web* don&#39;t work, presumably because they need the Jsr181 jar file.<br/>
<br/>
Either the wiki page is wrong, or the jar file is mia, or perhaps some other Jar is relevant?
