                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m new to cxf, currently trying to migrate from xfire&#39;s XFireWsdlGenTask, using the WsGen task from CXF-760.<br/>
<br/>
Probably doing something wrong, but the error messages from WsGen don&#39;t provide any helpful error message to let me find the problem.<br/>
<br/>
Here is what I&#39;m doing in the Ant build.xml:<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;taskdef name=&quot;cxfJava2wsdl&quot; classname=&quot;...WsGen&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;classpath&gt;<br/>
...<br/>
      &lt;/classpath&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/taskdef&gt;<br/>
    <br/>
    &lt;cxfJava2wsdl <br/>
      sei=&quot;...TextTaskWebSvcImpl&quot;<br/>
      resourcedestdir=&quot;${dir.build.soap}&quot;<br/>
      &gt;<br/>
    &lt;/cxfJava2wsdl&gt;<br/>
<br/>
