                                            <td class="description">      A toString that gives a string representation of the xml content is required for generated JAXB types. This is an option that is available at code gen type, when wsdl2java is used and the result is a toString method that will coaless the content. A &lt;null&gt; string should be produced when a field in the type is absent. <br/>
<br/>
This is handy for debugging and for logging.
