                <tr id="issuerow12373809" rel="12373809" data-issuekey="CXF-791" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-791" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-791">CXF-791</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JettyHTTPServerEngineFactory.createJettyHTTPServerEngine should be protected
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 14/Jul/07 01:31 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Dec/07 19:44 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 23/Jul/07 05:37 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      According to comments in JettyHTTPTransportEngine.getyJettyHTTPServerEngineFactory, the server factory must come off the bus. So, a person who wanted to customize the server engine factory would subclass the standard server engine factory and place the object of the specialized type on the bus.<br/>
<br/>
Sadly, this won&#39;t work, since the create method in the summary is not protected, but rather package default, and so a subclassed ServerEngineDactory is pretty comprehensively prevented from being even faintly useful.<br/>

  </td>
