</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      OOTB, CXF supports the November 2006 version of the Web services Policy 1.5 - Framework specification  (namespace: http://www.w3.org/2006/07/ws-policy/).<br/>
Backward support for the 2004 version can be &#39;enabled&#39; by programatically changing the namespace to http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2004/09/policy via the (static) API PolicyContstants.setNamespace (...) (in practice, the namespace name is the main difference).<br/>
To simultaneously  support different policy namespaces, but more so easily configure the namespace, the static API should be replaced by a dynamic one, e.g. PolicyEngine.setNamespace(...).<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
