</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add OOTB support for UsingAddressing assertion
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andrea Smyth
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andrea Smyth
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 16/Jul/07 16:31 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Aug/07 18:14 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Jul/07 14:01 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The actual namespace does not matter here - all of the following assertion types:<br/>
{http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2004/08/addressing/policy}UsingAddressing<br/>
{http://www.w3.org/2006/05/addressing/wsdl}UsingAddressing<br/>
{http://www.w3.org/2005/02/addressing/wsdl}UsingAddressing<br/>
should have the same effect of adding the addressing interceptors to the inbound/outbound interceptor chains.<br/>
The actual addressing version used then defaults to the http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing namespace, except in conjunction with RM where it is http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2004/08/addressing.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
