                                            <td class="description">      . Edit hello_world.wsdl, making a typo in the<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;wsdl:message name=&quot;greetMeRequest&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;wsdl:part element=&quot;x1:greetMe&quot; name=&quot;in&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/wsdl:message&gt; <br/>
<br/>
run wsdl2java -client , will get this error :<br/>
 WSDLToJava Error : velocity engine write errors<br/>
 It doesn&#39;t say where the error is, what it is, and generally doesn&#39;t give you any help.<br/>

