                <tr id="issuerow12374487" rel="12374487" data-issuekey="CXF-844" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-844" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-844">CXF-844</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                RPC/Lit null value parameters are skipped
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 24/Jul/07 18:39 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Aug/07 02:02 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/Jul/07 18:50 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Soap Binding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
If a parameter to a RPC/Lit operation is null, the soap binding just skips it and doesn&#39;t write out a part at all.   Thus, the soap message is invalid as the part accessor it missing.<br/>
<br/>
WSI BP R2211 states that RPC/Lit parts cannot be nillable.   Thus, an exception should be thrown.
  </td>
