26/07/2007 13:37:09 org.apache.cxf.transport.https.SSLUtils compileRegexPatterns<br/>
INFO: Ciphersuite include filter: .*_EXPORT1024_.*<br/>
26/07/2007 13:37:09 org.apache.cxf.transport.https.SSLUtils compileRegexPatterns<br/>
INFO: Ciphersuite include filter: .*_WITH_DES_.*<br/>
26/07/2007 13:37:09 org.apache.cxf.transport.https.SSLUtils compileRegexPatterns<br/>
INFO: Ciphersuite include filter: .*_WITH_NULL_.*<br/>
26/07/2007 13:37:09 org.apache.cxf.transport.https.SSLUtils getCiphersuites<br/>
INFO: The SSL_RSA_WITH_RC4_128_MD5 cipher suite is excluded by the filter.
