                                            <td class="description">      PolicyFeature is designed to manage multiple policy elements, but in practice one PolicyFeature element is created per &lt;wsp:Policy&gt; element that appears as a child of the &lt;jaxws:features xmlns:cxf=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/jaxws&quot;&gt; element (or the &lt;cxf:features xmlns:cxf=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/core&quot;&gt; element.<br/>
Also, the PolicyFeature should treat &lt;wsp:PolicyReference&gt; as well as &lt;wsp:Policy&gt; elements. <br/>
<br/>

