                <tr id="issuerow12374969" rel="12374969" data-issuekey="CXF-863" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-863" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-863">CXF-863</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Use CXF namespaces for all features.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andrea Smyth
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andrea Smyth
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Jul/07 16:37 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Oct/11 17:12 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 09/Sep/11 17:57 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Configuration            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">2</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Child elements of the  &lt;jaxws:features xmlns:jaxws=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/jaxws&gt; elements must be<br/>
a) custom beans for which the bean class that extends AbstractFeature (like &lt;cxf:logging xmlns:cxf=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/core&quot;&gt;)<br/>
b)  Spring &lt;bean&gt; elements with a bean class that extends AbstractFeature<br/>
c) Spring &lt;ref&gt; elements referencing a bean whose class extends AbstractFeature<br/>
Although b) and c) are supported, the preferred choice is be a)  as the whole point of the features and custom beans is to hide implementation details such as the bean class.<br/>
To allow consistent use of custom beans need to define BeanDefinitionParsers for all features. Currently these are missing for org.apache.cxf.databinding.stax.StaxDataBindingFeature and org.apache.cxf.management.interceptor.ResponseTimeFeature.<br/>

  </td>
