                                            <td class="description">      With 2.0.1 kit, both ws_addressing and ws_policy samples run successfully, however server spit warning message followed by a NullPointerException in following, can some one take a loot at this?<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
     [java] WARNING: SERVER_TRANSPORT_REBASE_FAILURE_MSG<br/>
