                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The file samples/README.txt contains the comment:<br/>
<br/>
To build and run the demos provided in the Apache CXF source distribution using ant you will need to edit the common_build.xml file. Uncomment the line: &lt;import file=&quot;../../../target/srcbuild_paths.xml&quot; optional=&quot;true&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
There is no need to do this, the line is already uncommented. Consequently, the paragraph should be removed from samples/README.txt.<br/>
<br/>
PS: The line in question in common_build.xml reads &lt;import file=&quot;${srcbuild_paths.file}&quot; optional=&quot;true&quot;/&gt;.
  </td>
