                                            <td class="description">      It will be different from what we have now, I would like to pack all<br/>
the required jars to $WAR/WEB-INF/lib folder, and then generate a WAR,<br/>
so if you want to deploy it to containers, what you need to do is to<br/>
copy the WAR to the container&#39;s deploy folder. you can see details in<br/>
this thread:<br/>
http://www.nabble.com/How-to-deploy-to-JBoss--tf4210975.html#a11978522<br/>
<br/>
For tomcat container, if you set the CATALINA_HOME, and then you run:<br/>
&quot;ant deploy-tomcat&quot; , it will copy the generated war to the<br/>
$CATALINA_HOME/webapps/
  </td>
