  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      ASM 3.0 causing serious troubles in using springframework because of changed signature of constructor org.objectweb.asm.ClassWriter(parameter changed from boolean to int). As I am aware spring is using ASM 2.2.2 and in further release (v2.1)  will be using ASM 2.2.3. Therefore I suggest fall back dependency to  ASM 2.2.x. 
