                <tr id="issuerow12376242" rel="12376242" data-issuekey="CXF-918" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-918" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-918">CXF-918</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                java code from wsdl2java for wrapped style if request and response have elements with the same names and different datatypes
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            maomaode
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            jmi
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            jmi
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Aug/07 14:54 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 30/Apr/08 14:54 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 04/Apr/08 01:11 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.1,                     2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.6            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-1229                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      java 1.5.0_09
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      wsdl2java renegares incorrect java code for some wsdls:<br/>
<br/>
wsdl uses &quot;wrapped style&quot; - request and response messages for operation, both have only one message-part. Each element referenced from message-part has different compex type, where both have multiple elements. <br/>
Problem is if there are two elements, one in request, one in response datatype, where both have the same name, but they have different datatype. In such situation a Holder is generated, which holds dataype from response. Request parameter is lost.<br/>
<br/>
maybe reason is common with bug 907
  </td>
