                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have a WSDL generated by my server, it uses Aegis databinding. I tried to create the client using wsdl2java and it throw the following error:<br/>
<br/>
$ wsdl2java -client http://localhost:8080/lor/services/DocumentService?wsdl<br/>
<br/>
WSDLToJava Error : Thrown by JAXB : undefined simple or complex type &#39;ns2:DocumentVO&#39;<br/>
<br/>
The error doesn&#39;t happen if I switch back to a JAXB data binding in my endpoint
