                <tr id="issuerow12376525" rel="12376525" data-issuekey="CXF-929" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-929" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-929">CXF-929</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Https connections recreated for each request
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Aug/07 17:17 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Oct/07 16:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/Aug/07 20:23 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
It looks like the Https connections are being recreated for each request which is causing about a 1 second handshake delay per request.       The Https stuff needs to honor keep-alives and such to make subsequent requests faster.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

