                <tr id="issuerow12376858" rel="12376858" data-issuekey="CXF-942" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-942" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-942">CXF-942</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                throwing SOAPFault from IMPL is not correctly mapped on the wire
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/Aug/07 01:33 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Sep/07 18:16 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Sep/07 18:16 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
Throwing a JAX-WS SOAPFault from a service IMPL does not result in the actor or details being written to the wire.<br/>
<br/>
         SOAPFactory factory = SOAPFactory.newInstance();<br/>
         SOAPFault fault = factory.createFault(&quot;this is a fault string!&quot;, new QName(&quot;http://foo&quot;, &quot;FooCode&quot;));<br/>
         fault.setFaultActor(&quot;mr.actor&quot;);<br/>
         fault.addDetail().addChildElement(&quot;test&quot;);<br/>
         throw new SOAPFaultException(fault);<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
results in:<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;soap:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;soap:Fault&gt;<br/>
&lt;faultcode&gt;soap:Server&lt;/faultcode&gt;<br/>
&lt;faultstring&gt;this is a fault string!&lt;/faultstring&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Fault&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
It should have the details (test element) and the actor element.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
