     [java] 	... 15 more<br/>
     [java] Exception: Error reading XMLStreamReader.<br/>
<br/>
I don&#39;t think the blog instructions themselves are the problem, because the same set of instructions works with CXF when accessing the Amazon E Commerce Service[2].  (What *might* be unique about the eBay WSDL is that it requires alteration of the default SEI URL in the WSDL, whereas Amazon&#39;s version doesn&#39;t.)<br/>
<br/>
[1] http://www.jroller.com/gmazza/entry/using_the_ebay_shopping_api1<br/>
[2] http://www.jroller.com/gmazza/entry/using_amazon_web_services_with<br/>
<br/>
If I have time, I will try to research this matter further.
