Java EE container - Spring 2.0.5, SOAP Toolkit Apache CXF 2.0.1
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When using AOP with JAX-WS Endpoint, the following exception occurs on server startup. The configuration is:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;bean id=&quot;airServiceProxy&quot; class=&quot;com.service.ServiceInterceptor&quot;&gt;				<br/>
		&lt;/bean&gt;	<br/>
			<br/>
		&lt;aop:config&gt;<br/>
			&lt;aop:aspect id=&quot;servicecontextaware&quot; ref=&quot;airServiceProxy&quot;&gt;<br/>
				&lt;aop:pointcut id=&quot;airServiceOperationForProxy&quot; expression=&quot;execution(* com.webservice.AirWebService.*(..))&quot;/&gt;<br/>
				<br/>
				&lt;aop:around pointcut-ref=&quot;airServiceOperationForProxy&quot; method=&quot;doServiceInvocation&quot;/&gt;<br/>
			&lt;/aop:aspect&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/aop:config&gt; <br/>
<br/>
<br/>
org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanCreationException: Error creating bean with name &#39;airWebService&#39;: Invocation of init method failed; nested exception is org.apache.cxf.service.factory.ServiceConstructionException: Could not find definition for service $Proxy14Service.<br/>
