                <tr id="issuerow12377256" rel="12377256" data-issuekey="CXF-959" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-959" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-959">CXF-959</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Incorrect namespace configuration when generating wsdl from Aegis databinding
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Brian Sawyer
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Brian Sawyer
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 31/Aug/07 17:35 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Oct/07 16:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Sep/07 21:59 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Using CXF 2.0.1
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Following is an example service and its generated wsdl:<br/>
<br/>
import com.basistech.stuff.Name;<br/>
<br/>
@WebService(name=&quot;NameService&quot;, targetNamespace=&quot;urn:com.basistech.service&quot;)<br/>
public interface NameService {<br/>
    @WebMethod<br/>
     public abstract List&lt;Name&gt; listAvailableNames();<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
&lt;wsdl:definitions name=&quot;NameService&quot; targetNamespace=&quot;http://nameService.basistech.com&quot; xmlns:ns1=&quot;http://nameService.basistech.com&quot; xmlns:xsd=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema&quot; xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/wsdl/soap/&quot; xmlns:wsdl=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/wsdl/&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;wsdl:types&gt;<br/>
     &lt;schema xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema&quot; attributeFormDefault=&quot;qualified&quot; elementFormDefault=&quot;qualified&quot; targetNamespace=&quot;http://stuff.basistech.com&quot;&gt;<br/>
         &lt;complexType name=&quot;ArrayOfName&quot;&gt;<br/>
             &lt;sequence&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;element maxOccurs=&quot;unbounded&quot; minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; name=&quot;Name&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;ns1:Name&quot;/&gt;<br/>
             &lt;/sequence&gt;<br/>
         &lt;/complexType&gt;<br/>
         &lt;complexType name=&quot;Name&quot;&gt;<br/>
             &lt;sequence&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;element minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; name=&quot;data&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;element minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; name=&quot;uid&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
             &lt;/sequence&gt;<br/>
         &lt;/complexType&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/schema&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
 ArrayOfName is said to contain an element of type ns1:Name.  However, ns1 is set to &quot;http://nameService.basistech.com&quot; when Name is actually located in the &quot;http://stuff.basistech.com&quot; namespace.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
