                <tr id="issuerow12377344" rel="12377344" data-issuekey="CXF-966" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-966" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-966">CXF-966</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                SESSION_MAINTAIN_PROPERTY doesn&#39;t track cookies other than JSESSIONID
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Joe Sunday
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Joe Sunday
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 03/Sep/07 05:07 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Oct/07 16:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 04/Sep/07 03:11 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.1,                     2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When using CXF as a client, SESSION_MAINTAIN_PROPERTY only tracks the session id from the server if the cookie is named JSESSIONID. It does not track the session id if the server is using a different cookie name.<br/>
<br/>
It should track all Set-Cookie headers from the server.
  </td>
