                <tr id="issuerow12377855" rel="12377855" data-issuekey="CXF-984" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-984" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-984">CXF-984</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Allow user control of namespace prefixes in Aegis
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/Sep/07 02:44 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Oct/07 16:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 18/Sep/07 17:59 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      For &#39;primitive&#39; clients, it can be helpful to be able to predict in advance what prefixes will be used for at least some interesting namespaces. This is a service-level issue, since trying to assign prefixes at the level of types (or packages) can lead to conflicts and confusion.<br/>
<br/>
The patch I will attach here allows the user to pass a map from namespace-&gt;prefix to the AegisDatabinding bean as a way of grabbing control of prefix assignment. 
  </td>
