                <tr id="issuerow12377862" rel="12377862" data-issuekey="CXF-985" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-985" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-985">CXF-985</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Wrong java version verification
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Diego Plentz
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Diego Plentz
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/Sep/07 06:01 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 02/Oct/07 18:25 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 02/Oct/07 18:25 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Samples            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In samples\common_build.xml, the java verification is wrong. It just check if java version is equals, but, must be &gt; 1.5. A simple way to solve this is doing something like this.<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;condition property=&quot;is.java.version.15&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;or&gt;<br/>
        &lt;equals arg1=&quot;${ant.java.version}&quot; arg2=&quot;1.5&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;equals arg1=&quot;${ant.java.version}&quot; arg2=&quot;1.6&quot;/&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/or&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/condition&gt;
  </td>
